<br>
I can bring in a 51 warrior and 51 Paladin and 52ish Necro for CR(only) if it's needed.  I'm sure they wouldn't mind helping, the Pally is my brother, and the other warrior is a good friend.  If things went wrong though, heheh you guys will have to pay for the coffins,..hehehehe<br>
<br>
So, if you think your just lacking the tank power, I should be able to help in that arena.<br>
